# The single source of truth for line endings.
#
# Without this file, Windows runs core.autocrlf=true: git substitutes CRLF on every checkout while
# .prettierrc demands endOfLine=lf — and `pnpm format:check` goes red on dozens of files right
# after cloning, with nobody having changed anything. Reconfiguring git per developer is not the
# fix: that setting is per machine, the requirement is per repository.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf`: LF in the index and LF in the working tree, regardless of autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never touched: normalization would corrupt them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
